OL,3,ABarristers must stop using rape myths
OL,4,Ain trials, justice secretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BSB said it had set up an expert
OL,7,Fgroup this year to advise on
OL,8,F"strengthening standards for
OL,9,Fbarristers", while the Bar Council said
OL,10,Fdefendants had a "right to have
OL,11,Fevidence tested in court".
